<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Used to wallrun behind (S) for parkour roblox</Major>
    <Description>do the first dash and then press the macro u will wallrun back
its pretty easy and i dont really need to explain any more the wallrun delay is better that way please dont change it
if u want it to work</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 45 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 45 1
Delay 70 ms
KeyDown 44 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>